## Generation Workflow

Follow this pipeline exactly for every document request:

```
1. Parse user intent (doc type, content, diagrams needed)
2. Select document class + packages
3. Apply design system (colors, fonts, layout)
4. Write LaTeX source with all sections
5. Embed diagrams using TikZ / PGFPlots
6. Write to /home/claude/<slug>.tex
7. Compile: pdflatex -interaction=nonstopmode <file>.tex (run TWICE for refs)
8. Move output to /mnt/user-data/outputs/<slug>.pdf
9. Call present_files to deliver to user
```

**Always compile twice** to resolve cross-references, TOC, and hyperlinks.

