# Professional LaTeX PDF Engine

Generate **publication-ready PDFs** with professional typography, design consistency,
and embedded diagrams — all compiled from LaTeX directly in the environment.

---

## Capabilities

| Feature | Support |
|---|---|
| Technical Reports | ✅ Full |
| Developer CVs | ✅ Full |
| Research Papers | ✅ Full |
| Architecture Docs | ✅ Full |
| Flowcharts (TikZ) | ✅ Full |
| System Diagrams | ✅ Full |
| Sequence Diagrams | ✅ Full |
| Data Plots (PGFPlots) | ✅ Full |
| Gantt Charts | ✅ Full |
| UML Diagrams | ✅ Full |
| Code Blocks (listings) | ✅ Full |
| Tables (booktabs) | ✅ Full |

---

## Design System

### Color Palette

```latex
\definecolor{primary}{HTML}{1E3A8A}    % Deep Blue    — headings, titles
\definecolor{secondary}{HTML}{475569}  % Slate Gray   — subheadings, captions
\definecolor{accent}{HTML}{14B8A6}     % Soft Teal    — links, highlights, rules
\definecolor{neutral}{HTML}{111827}    % Dark Gray    — body text
\definecolor{surface}{HTML}{F3F4F6}    % Light Gray   — callout backgrounds
\definecolor{danger}{HTML}{DC2626}     % Red          — warnings
\definecolor{success}{HTML}{16A34A}    % Green        — notes, tips
```

### Typography

| Element | Font | Size | Style |
|---|---|---|---|
| Document Title | Latin Modern | 22pt | Bold, Primary |
| Section | Latin Modern | 14pt | Bold, Primary |
| Subsection | Latin Modern | 12pt | Bold, Secondary |
| Body | Latin Modern | 11pt | Regular |
| Code | Courier / tt | 9pt | Monospace |
| Caption | Latin Modern | 9pt | Italic, Secondary |

### Layout

```
Margins:   Top 1in · Bottom 1in · Left 1.1in · Right 1.1in
Line spacing: 1.15
Paragraph indent: 0pt
Paragraph skip: 6pt
Header: document title (left) · page number (right)
Footer: author · date
```

---

## Generation Workflow

Follow this pipeline exactly for every document request:

```
1. Parse user intent (doc type, content, diagrams needed)
2. Select document class + packages
3. Apply design system (colors, fonts, layout)
4. Write LaTeX source with all sections
5. Embed diagrams using TikZ / PGFPlots
6. Write to /home/claude/<slug>.tex
7. Compile: pdflatex -interaction=nonstopmode <file>.tex (run TWICE for refs)
8. Move output to /mnt/user-data/outputs/<slug>.pdf
9. Call present_files to deliver to user
```

**Always compile twice** to resolve cross-references, TOC, and hyperlinks.

---

## Master Template

Use this as the base for every document. Customize per document type.

```latex
\documentclass[11pt, a4paper]{article}

% ── Core Layout ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
\usepackage[top=1in, bottom=1in, left=1.1in, right=1.1in]{geometry}
\usepackage{parskip}
\usepackage{microtype}
\usepackage{charter}          % Professional serif body font (lmodern alternative)
\usepackage[T1]{fontenc}
\usepackage[utf8]{inputenc}

% ── Colors & Graphics ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
\usepackage{xcolor}
\usepackage{graphicx}
\usepackage{tikz}
\usepackage{pgfplots}
\pgfplotsset{compat=1.18}
\usetikzlibrary{
  arrows.meta, shapes.geometric, shapes, positioning,
  fit, calc, decorations.pathreplacing, matrix, chains,
  shadows.blur, backgrounds
}

% ── Design Tokens ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
\definecolor{primary}{HTML}{1E3A8A}
\definecolor{secondary}{HTML}{475569}
\definecolor{accent}{HTML}{14B8A6}
\definecolor{neutral}{HTML}{111827}
\definecolor{surface}{HTML}{F3F4F6}
\definecolor{danger}{HTML}{DC2626}
\definecolor{success}{HTML}{16A34A}

% ── Typography ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
\usepackage{titlesec}
\titleformat{\section}
  {\color{primary}\large\bfseries\sffamily}{\thesection}{1em}{}[
    \vspace{-4pt}\color{accent}\hrule height 0.8pt\vspace{4pt}]
\titleformat{\subsection}
  {\color{secondary}\normalsize\bfseries\sffamily}{\thesubsection}{1em}{}
\titleformat{\subsubsection}
  {\color{secondary}\small\bfseries\itshape}{\thesubsubsection}{1em}{}
\titlespacing{\section}{0pt}{14pt}{6pt}
\titlespacing{\subsection}{0pt}{10pt}{4pt}

% ── Header & Footer ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
\usepackage{fancyhdr}
\pagestyle{fancy}
\fancyhf{}
\renewcommand{\headrulewidth}{0.4pt}
\renewcommand{\headrule}{\hbox to\headwidth{\color{accent}\leaders\hrule height \headrulewidth\hfill}}
\fancyhead[L]{\small\color{secondary}\sffamily\thetitle}
\fancyhead[R]{\small\color{secondary}\sffamily Page \thepage}
\fancyfoot[L]{\small\color{secondary}\sffamily\theauthor}
\fancyfoot[R]{\small\color{secondary}\sffamily\thedate}

% ── Tables ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
\usepackage{booktabs}
\usepackage{array}
\usepackage{multirow}
\usepackage{tabularx}
\usepackage{colortbl}         % Required for \rowcolor in tables
\newcommand{\tablehead}[1]{\rowcolor{primary}\color{white}\textbf{#1}}

% ── Code Listings ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
\usepackage{listings}
\lstset{
  backgroundcolor=\color{surface},
  basicstyle=\footnotesize\ttfamily\color{neutral},
  keywordstyle=\color{primary}\bfseries,
  commentstyle=\color{secondary}\itshape,
  stringstyle=\color{accent},
  numberstyle=\tiny\color{secondary},
  numbers=left, numbersep=8pt,
  frame=single, framerule=0.5pt, rulecolor=\color{accent},
  breaklines=true, showstringspaces=false,
  aboveskip=8pt, belowskip=8pt,
  xleftmargin=12pt
}

% ── Callout Boxes ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
\usepackage{tcolorbox}
\tcbuselibrary{breakable, skins}

\newtcolorbox{infobox}[1][Note]{
  colback=surface, colframe=accent, coltitle=white,
  fonttitle=\sffamily\bfseries\small, title=#1,
  arc=4pt, boxrule=1pt, breakable
}
\newtcolorbox{warnbox}[1][Warning]{
  colback=danger!8, colframe=danger, coltitle=white,
  fonttitle=\sffamily\bfseries\small, title=#1,
  arc=4pt, boxrule=1pt, breakable
}
\newtcolorbox{tipbox}[1][Tip]{
  colback=success!8, colframe=success, coltitle=white,
  fonttitle=\sffamily\bfseries\small, title=#1,
  arc=4pt, boxrule=1pt, breakable
}

% ── Hyperlinks ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
\usepackage{hyperref}
\hypersetup{
  colorlinks=true, linkcolor=accent, urlcolor=accent, citecolor=secondary,
  pdftitle={Document Title}, pdfauthor={Author Name}
}

% ── Lists ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
\usepackage{enumitem}
\setlist[itemize]{leftmargin=1.5em, itemsep=2pt, parsep=0pt}
\setlist[enumerate]{leftmargin=1.5em, itemsep=2pt, parsep=0pt}

% ── Document Metadata ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
\makeatletter
\let\thetitle\@title
\let\theauthor\@author
\let\thedate\@date
\makeatother

\title{Document Title}
\author{Author Name}
\date{\today}

% ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
\begin{document}

% ── Cover Page ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
\begin{titlepage}
  \centering
  \vspace*{2cm}
  {\color{primary}\rule{\linewidth}{2pt}}\vspace{12pt}
  {\Huge\bfseries\sffamily\color{primary} Document Title \par}\vspace{8pt}
  {\color{accent}\rule{\linewidth}{1pt}}\vspace{16pt}
  {\large\color{secondary} Subtitle or Tagline \par}\vspace{2cm}
  {\normalsize\color{neutral} Author Name \par}
  {\small\color{secondary} \today \par}
  \vfill
  {\small\color{secondary}\itshape Version 1.0}
\end{titlepage}

\tableofcontents
\newpage

\section{Introduction}
% Content here

\end{document}
```

